UC5 .> UC11 : <<include>>
UC_Clone .> UC7 : <<extend>> \n [chọn sao chép từ mẫu]

Anonymous --> UC1
Anonymous --> UC2
User --> UC3

Admin --> UC4
Admin --> UC5
Admin --> UC6

Owner --> UC7
Owner --> UC8
Owner --> UC9
Owner --> UC10
Owner --> UC11
Owner --> UC12

